@startuml
title USBD34 – Associate a Freight with a Train

actor "Logistics Manager" as LM
participant "Application" as APP
participant "Database" as DB

LM -> APP : 1. Request freight-train association(freightId, trainId)
APP -> DB : 2. Execute function associate_freight_train(freightId, trainId)
DB --> APP : 3. Return SYS_REFCURSOR with association details
APP --> LM : 4. Display confirmation and association result
@enduml